# Erasure (GC-2026-0814 #5) against ten-year retention (#4). A draft that was never submitted is deleted at
# once, rows and images. A submitted application is restricted: processing stops, the record stays until
# retention ends. Whether retention overrides erasure is an open question for Compliance.

@onboarding = http://localhost:5100
@image = /9j/4EFUTEFTIFRFU1QgSU1BR0X/2Q==

### 1. A draft with two images.
# @name draft
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ]
}

### 2. Erase it: 200 DELETED. The token no longer works (401), and the blobs are gone.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{draft.response.body.applicationId}}/erasure
X-Application-Token: {{draft.response.body.applicationToken}}

### 3. A submitted application.
# @name submitted
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Tester",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "nationality": "XB",
  "countryOfResidence": "XB",
  "identifier": { "type": "NATIONAL_ID", "value": "9876543210987", "issuingCountry": "XB" },
  "email": "applicant@example.test",
  "phone": "+15550100100",
  "documents": [
    { "type": "PASSPORT", "image": "{{image}}" },
    { "type": "SELFIE", "image": "{{image}}" }
  ],
  "termsAccepted": true
}

### 4. Erase it: 202 RESTRICTED with deleteAfter ten years from submission.
POST {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{submitted.response.body.applicationId}}/erasure
X-Application-Token: {{submitted.response.body.applicationToken}}

### 5. The applicant sees WITHDRAWN; nothing can be changed or activated any more.
GET {{onboarding}}/v1/markets/MB/applications/{{submitted.response.body.applicationId}}
X-Application-Token: {{submitted.response.body.applicationToken}}
